{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Resource.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Resource.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"resource resource","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Resource.md","fileName":"Resource.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Resource","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 14:36\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[System Dynamics]] [[Game Economies]] [[Game Rewards and Consequences]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["System Dynamics","Game Economies","Game Rewards and Consequences","System","System Source","Stock","Converter","System Sink","advancedgamedesign.pdf","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Resource.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Resource.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"resource resource","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Resource.md","fileName":"Resource.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Resource","heading":"Resource","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A resource is something countable that can be generated, stored, transferred, exchanged, converted, or removed within a [[System]]. It may be physical, such as wood, or abstract, such as health, time, movement, or experience.\n\nResources flow among functional roles such as [[System Source]], [[Stock]], [[Converter]], and [[System Sink]]. A simple resource is interchangeable with others of its type, while a complex resource may be assembled from simpler resources and carry distinct attributes.\n\nWithin games, a resource can enable a verb: ammunition permits shooting, currency permits spending, and health determines how much harm can be endured before a setback. Because resources are countable, they support decisions about saving, spending, and accepting risk.","tags":["baby"],"links":["System Dynamics","Game Economies","Game Rewards and Consequences","System","System Source","Stock","Converter","System Sink","advancedgamedesign.pdf","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Resource.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Resource.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"resource resource","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Resource.md","fileName":"Resource.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Resource","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[advancedgamedesign.pdf]]\n[[agamedesignvocabulary.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["System Dynamics","Game Economies","Game Rewards and Consequences","System","System Source","Stock","Converter","System Sink","advancedgamedesign.pdf","agamedesignvocabulary.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}